OL,3,AFour arrested during gangland violence
OL,4,A'day of action'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have arrested four men during a
OL,7,Fpre-planned "day of action" as part of
OL,8,Fan ongoing investigation into gangland
OL,9,Fviolence.
OL,11,FPolice executed warrants at addresses
OL,12,Fin Bellshill and Motherwell on Friday
OL,13,Fand also recovered four stolen
OL,14,Fvehicles.
OL,16,FOne of the men arrested, a 29-year-old,
OL,17,Fwas charged after a car crashed into a
OL,18,Fhouse in Eaglesham on Friday 21 August.
OL,19,FThere were no reports of any injuries.
OL,20,FHe is due to appear in court on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
